				<wikidot:authorName>rthuber</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1905550</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Well, so far the graffiti have been relatively small, contained affairs. Except for the log where it was where a whole airplane load of people saw/read it.</p> <p>Now imagine it written in a busy subway.</p> <p>Or on a STOP sign near a busy intersection.</p> <p>Or somehow writ large on the side of a building in full view of half a city. (Granted there's no indication in the article that it could happen, but all we can be sure of is that it hasn't happened yet.)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
